+"""Face-mesh subset stored in the raw cache.
+
+Union of MediaPipe's semantic contours (lips, eyes, brows, irises, face oval,
+nose) plus head-pose / expression anchors used by the solver. Storing all 478
+refined mesh points would add ~45 MB per 3-minute clip for dense cheek and
+forehead fill that no solver stage reads. Indices refer to the 478-point
+refined mesh and are stored in the cache header, so consumers never guess.
+"""
+
+FACE_SUBSET: list[int] = [
+    0, 1, 2, 4, 5, 6, 7, 10, 13, 14, 17, 19, 21, 33, 37, 39, 40, 45, 46, 48, 50, 52, 53, 54, 55,
